Design system
-------------

The look, the favicon (the brand's logo symbol) and the status badge come
from the package design-system, LazurioTemplates/design-system v2.0.0,
Copyright (c) 2026 Lazurio contributors, MIT. It is a dependency, not part
of this repository. An Organization that depends on its own design system
takes that design system's license with it.

Third-party material
--------------------

No font, image, icon set or other third-party asset is distributed in this
repository.

- Fonts and icons. The static build carries the font files the design
  system's package ships, Inter, Inter Tight and Geist Mono, under the SIL
  Open Font License 1.1 (their licence texts are in the package, in
  app/v1/kit/fonts/), and the icon of the status badge, from Iconoir (MIT,
  app/v1/kit/licenses/ in the package).
- Dependencies. The viewer installs its npm dependencies at preparation time
  (app/v2/package.json, app/v2/bun.lock); they are not part of this
  repository and keep their own licenses: Astro, Starlight and
  @astrojs/check (MIT), @lazurio/module-kit (MIT), design-system (MIT),
  mdast-util-from-markdown,
  micromark-extension-gfm, mdast-util-gfm, micromark-extension-directive and
  mdast-util-directive (MIT), parse5 (MIT), TypeScript (Apache-2.0), Biome
  (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and @types/bun (MIT). The static build contains
  the code Astro, Starlight and Pagefind generate for the pages.
